       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-METAPHOR-SOUND.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-METAPHOR-SOUND-PROOFS.
           05  WS-SEMANTIC-CONGRUENCE-OK   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-CULTURAL-GROUNDING-OK    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-ANTI-DISSONANCE-OK       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TACTILE-IMMEDIACY-OK     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-METAPHOR-SEAL-OK         PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-METAPHOR-SOUND-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-METAPHOR-PROVEN      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-METAPHOR-CODE      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-CONGRUENCE-AND-GROUNDING.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-DISSONANCE-AND-IMMEDIACY.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-METAPHOR-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-CONGRUENCE-AND-GROUNDING.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-SEMANTIC-CONGRUENCE-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-CULTURAL-GROUNDING-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-DISSONANCE-AND-IMMEDIACY.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-ANTI-DISSONANCE-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-TACTILE-IMMEDIACY-OK.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-METAPHOR-PROOFS.
           IF WS-SEMANTIC-CONGRUENCE-OK = 1 AND
              WS-CULTURAL-GROUNDING-OK = 1 AND
              WS-ANTI-DISSONANCE-OK = 1 AND
              WS-TACTILE-IMMEDIACY-OK = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-METAPHOR-SEAL-OK
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-METAPHOR-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-METAPHOR-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-METAPHOR-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-METAPHOR-CODE.
